# WEB7 input tape script. The browser check (tools/web-input-check.mjs) replays these events as real key and
# mouse events and the input_tape bin replays them on the PC; both must give the same tape bytes.
# Keys are KeyboardEvent.code, mouse buttons are MouseEvent.button, `tick` samples one record.
key KeyW down
tick
key KeyD down
key KeyF down
tick
key KeyF up
mouse 2 down
tick
mouse 2 up
key KeyW up
tick
key ShiftLeft down
mouse 0 down
tick
mouse 0 up
key ShiftLeft up
key KeyD up
tick
